{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "owner": "Christopher Ford, Head of Data & Analytics, Gymreapers",
  "purpose": "Canonical product taxonomy. Single source of truth for product organization across all channels. Each channel (Shopify, Amazon, GNC, future) maps INTO this hierarchy, never the other way around.",
  "last_updated": "2026-04-24",
  "_notes": [
    "Hierarchy levels: Division -> Department -> Class -> Style -> SKU.",
    "Facets are orthogonal to the hierarchy. Filter and pivot, do not encode into class names.",
    "Slugs are immutable once published. Names can be edited freely. Slugs in code, names in UI.",
    "match_rules are case-insensitive substring matches against (product_type + title + handle). First class to match wins. Authority order is the array order within a department, then department within division. Audit by re-running explode and reviewing diffs."
  ],
  "divisions": [
    {
      "slug": "equipment_gear",
